Adjudication of every pre-registered hypothesis against the frozen grid, in the order they were tested. Two are not supported in the sense their authors intended: H1, because the boundary is reachable only at the far end of the lag axis and the operational rule is not specific there; and H5, which is formally satisfied by an interior maximum whose size is smaller than the sampling error of a single cell. H1' is the hypothesis added by Amendment 1 and is adjudicated alongside the five pre-registered ones. Generated from `results/tables/t00_hypotheses.csv` and `results/B3/aggregate.csv`; the H3 row is added here because the results layer does not adjudicate it. Source: `reference_results/`.
